{"about_the_game":"A unique typing/bullet hell game where both halves of the action are nonstop! Test your typing skills with one hand and dodge with the other.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing pounding electronic music and stylized ASCII-art visuals, HyperTyper 2000 also lets you hone your typing skills with an adjustable Assist Mode to slow down the pace, limit word length, and more! Not enough of a challenge? Do the opposite, and amp up the game speed while making the words even longer!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nType any word to attack an enemy from any distance - hit another enemy while a projectile is close by to parry it and send it flying back to the attacker!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBattle your way through progressively harder challenges, or shoot for a new high score in a classic arcade mode.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3125430?t=1756841863","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756841863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756841863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756841863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3973910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"A unique typing/bullet hell game where both halves of the action are nonstop! Test your typing skills with one hand and dodge with the other.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing pounding electronic music and stylized ASCII-art visuals, HyperTyper 2000 also lets you hone your typing skills with an adjustable Assist Mode to slow down the pace, limit word length, and more! Not enough of a challenge? Do the opposite, and amp up the game speed while making the words even longer!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nType any word to attac